✅ Hex/binary/octal integers (0xFF, 0b1010, 0o777)
✅ Complex SI units (W/(m·K), J/(kg·K), m²/s, F/m, H/m)
✅ Keywords as property names (tolerance, trace, via, clearance, category, material, profile)
✅ Zero values (0.0, 0%)
✅ Fractional percentages (0.001%, 78.08%)
✅ Positive/negative prefixes (+1.5e-3, -2.7e-4)
✅ Extreme precision (1.23456789012345)
✅ Frequency-dependent properties (1mhz, 1ghz, 10ghz, 77ghz)
✅ Asymmetric properties (xy vs z thermal expansion)
✅ Inline comments everywhere
✅ Doc comments (##) and block comments (#[...])
✅ All punctuation in strings
✅ Boundary values (absolute zero, sun temperature)
✅ Mixed units (Pa, Pa·s, m²/s, V/mm, Ω·m)
✅ Anisotropic properties (c-axis vs a-axis)
✅ Composition percentages (81%, 13%, 4%, 2%)

GOAL: Find compiler gaps in material definition parsing!
]#



## ============================================================================
## SILICON DIOXIDE (SiO2) - Gate Oxide and Passivation
## ============================================================================

material SiO2:
    category: insulator
    symbol: "SiO₂"
    description: "Silicon dioxide - gate oxide and passivation layer for CMOS transistors"
    
    properties:
        ## Physical Properties
        density: 2200kg/m³
        thermal_conductivity: 1.4W/(m·K)
        thermal_expansion: 0.5e-6/°C          # Very low thermal expansion
        
        ## Electrical Properties
        dielectric_constant: 3.9              # Relative permittivity
        dielectric_strength: 10000V/mm        # 10 MV/cm breakdown field
        volume_resistivity: 1e16Ω·m          # Excellent insulator
        band_gap: 9.0eV                       # Wide band gap
        
        ## Mechanical Properties
        youngs_modulus: 70e9Pa                # 70 GPa
        hardness: 7.0GPa                      # Mohs hardness ~7
        
        ## Thermal Properties
        melting_point: 1710°C                 # High melting point
        max_operating_temp: 1000°C            # Stable at high temperatures
        min_operating_temp: -273°C            # Stable to absolute zero
        
        ## Optical Properties
        refractive_index: 1.46                # At 589 nm (sodium D-line)
        transparency_range: "UV to IR"        # Transparent in wide range
        
        ## Thickness Properties (for gate oxide)
        typical_gate_oxide_thickness: 2e-9m   # 2 nm for modern processes
        tunnel_oxide_thickness: 1.5e-9m       # 1.5 nm for flash memory
        
        ## Color & Rendering
        color: "#E0E0FF"                      # Light blue tint
        transparency: 0.8                     # Semi-transparent for visualization
